--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A NOTE ON THE DATA

Every number, user, review, support ticket and bank in this kit is synthetic.
"Nimbus" is not a real product, the banks in the mock app are invented, and no
figure here describes any real company's performance. The dataset is constructed
so that the exercises have correct answers — including a deliberate confounder —
and it should never be cited as evidence about anything outside this workshop.

